  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "SNG 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By night on my bed I sought him whom my soul loveth: I sought him, but I found him not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will rise now, and go about the city in the streets, and in the broad ways I will seek him whom my soul loveth: I sought him, but I found him not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The watchmen that go about the city found me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to whom I said",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Saw ye him whom my soul loveth?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "It was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but a little that I passed from them, but I found him whom my soul loveth: I held him, and would not let him go, until I had brought him into my mother's house, and into the chamber of her that conceived me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I charge you, O ye daughters of Jerusalem, by the roes, and by the hinds of the field, that ye stir not up, nor awake",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "my",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "love, till he please.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this that cometh out of the wilderness like pillars of smoke, perfumed with myrrh and frankincense, with all powders of the merchant?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold his bed, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon's; threescore valiant men",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "about it, of the valiant of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They all hold swords,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "being",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "expert in war: every man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "hath",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his sword upon his thigh because of fear in the night.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King Solomon made himself a chariot of the wood of Lebanon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He made the pillars thereof",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "silver, the bottom thereof",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gold, the covering of it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "purple, the midst thereof being paved",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "love, for the daughters of Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go forth, O ye daughters of Zion, and behold king Solomon with the crown wherewith his mother crowned him in the day of his espousals, and in the day of the gladness of his heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
